flowchart LR

    D1[(D1 Operational Store)]

    EXPORT[Export Contract]

    BATCH[Transfer Batch]

    HASH[Hash Validation]

    D2[(D2 Historical Store)]

    FORECAST[Forecast Analytics]

    BACKTEST[Backtesting]

    RESEARCH[Research Datasets]

    AZIZ[Future AZIZ]

    SCORE[Future Mizan Score]

    D1 --> EXPORT

    EXPORT --> BATCH

    BATCH --> HASH

    HASH -->|PASS| D2
    HASH -->|FAIL| QUARANTINE[Quarantine Queue]

    D2 --> FORECAST
    D2 --> BACKTEST
    D2 --> RESEARCH
    D2 --> AZIZ
    D2 --> SCORE

    AZIZ -. Read Only .-> D2
    SCORE -. Read Only .-> D2

    D2 -. No Direct Write .-> D1
